    capture_write_check_misses_mutating_method_calls_2026_11_10, 0, "Closures capture enclosing locals by value, read-only (.claude/rules/language.md). capture_write_check.spl and seed capture_write_check.rs rejected assignment to a captured local but silently accepted receiver-mutating calls (push/insert/remove/pop/clear/set/sort/extend/append) whose effect is dropped with the by-value snapshot."

